# a function word before more words than it takes takes the phrase of the function word after it (card prelude-word-calls)
'f(x) := x; g(a) := a; f g 1'	1
'g(a) := [a]; first g 1'	1
'f(x) := x; g(a) := a; h(y) := y * 2; f g h 3'	6
'add(a, b) := a + b; twice(x) := 2 * x; twice add 1 2'	6
'apply(f, x) := f(x); sq(x) := x * x; apply sq 3'	9
